<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>花卉供应链管理平台</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.container{text-align:center;padding:40px;max-width:600px}
h1{color:#1a1a2e;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px}
p{color:#666;margin-bottom:32px;font-size:14px}
.cards{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px 32px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);text-decoration:none;color:#333;transition:transform 0.2s,box-shadow 0.2s;flex:1;min-width:180px}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
.card h2{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px;color:#1a1a2e}
.card .port{font-size:13px;color:#1890ff;margin-top:8px}
.footer{margin-top:40px;font-size:12px;color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <h1>🌺 花卉供应链管理平台</h1>
  <p>请选择要进入的管理系统</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <a href="http://100.96.54.109:31001" class="card">
      <h2>📦 商品管理</h2>
      <p>商品 SKU / 采购 / 库存</p>
      <div class="port">port 3001</div>
    </a>
    <a href="http://100.96.54.109:31002" class="card">
      <h2>🤝 供应商管理</h2>
      <p>供应商 / 合同 / 资质</p>
      <div class="port">port 3002</div>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">supply-chain-platform · nginx-gateway :8088</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
